/* VideoPlayer component styles */
.video-container {
  position: relative;
}

.like-button {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 10px;
  right: 10px;
  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
  border: none;
  border-radius: 5px;
  padding: 5px 10px;
  font-size: 16px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background-color 0.3s;
}

.like-button:hover {
  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1);
}
```
These styles give your app a dark background color, use a modern font, and apply white text, similar to Netflix's color scheme. The styles for the like button and video feed remain the same, but the colors and font have been adjusted to match the dark theme.

Feel free to customize these styles further to achieve the desired look for your app. You can also explore using other dark color schemes, or consider adding gradients, shadows, and subtle animations to enhance the user experience."
